WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.240
Christ came and lived a life without one sin, not one.

2
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:16.000
That's the life that must cover me to qualify me for God's kingdom.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.000
You didn't hear what I said?

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.540
That seems to be your habit.

5
00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:23.040
Listen to me again.

6
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.160
Christ came and lived what kind of life?

7
00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:29.840
A sinless life, meaning he lived what kind of life?

8
00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.920
Isn't that a word?

9
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:37.120
Ah, he lived an obedient life.

10
00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:41.680
For those of you who think the law doesn't matter, he lived a life in perfect harmony

11
00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.960
with his father's law.

12
00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:48.840
That is the life that covers the one who surrenders to Christ, an obedient life lived by Jesus

13
00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:54.040
Christ, flawlessly, and he offers that to you and me.

14
00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:59.920
But even though it's his life that qualifies us, when you and I understand that, our day
